Description: A retrieval, filtering, and plotting client for the live
    (updated weekly) G-TROPIC collection of tropical cyclone exposure
    datasets published on Harvard Dataverse. Exposure datasets include
    wind, precipitation, and flooding data at second-level administrative
    unit (ADM2) resolution for every ADM2 and International Best Track
    Archive for Climate Stewardship (IBTrACS) recorded storm globally,
    from 1980 to the present. Provides a single cornerstone query
    function, discovery helpers for exploring the available vocabulary of
    administrative units and storms, version manifests for reproducible
    re-retrieval, and an optional opt-in on-disk cache. The package
    performs no scientific recomputation, published exposure columns are
    authoritative.
